# AI Coaching FAQ & Lead Capture Bot

An automated Telegram chatbot built with n8n, OpenAI, and Google Sheets. The bot answers coaching-related questions using a PDF brochure and records student inquiries in a lead-management spreadsheet.

This project connects a conversational interface with document-based question answering and CRM automation, demonstrating how a student inquiry can move from a Telegram message to an AI-generated reply and a saved lead.

