## Problem This Project Addresses

Coaching institutes receive repeated questions about their programmes, study material, course duration, and admissions. Answering these inquiries manually and maintaining a separate record of interested students can involve repetitive work.

This workflow combines two tasks:

- Responding to student questions using a configured information source.
- Recording inquiries in a spreadsheet for later review and follow-up.

The project demonstrates an automated first-response and lead-capture process. It does not replace the admission team or independently confirm information missing from the brochure.

